      "extract": "This is a short survey of some results of P. Bleher, J. Neuheisel, B. Shiffman and the author on random polynomials and their generalizations to holomorphic (and almost-holomorphic) sections of ample line bundles, mainly following [@BSZ1; @BSZ2; @BSZ3; @N; @SZ1; @SZ2; @SZ3; @SZ4; @Ze1; @Ze2]. Motivation to study random polynomials and their generalizations in geometry comes from several sources: - Classical",
