      "extract": "We will restrict attention to two related ensembles: - *Gaussian ensembles*: We fix an orthonormal basis $\\{f_j\\}$ of ${\\mathcal H}_N$ and write functions as orthonormal sums $f = \\sum_{j = 1}^{d_N} c_j f_j$. We then define the (complex) Gaussian measure by $$\\gamma = e^{- ||f||^2} {\\mathcal D}f,\\;\\; \\mbox{i.e.} \\;\\; \\gamma = e^{- |c|^2} dc.$$ More generally we fix a symmetric matrix $\\Delta$ on ${\\mathbb C}^{d_N}$",
