      "extract": "We have results on several levels: expected values, almost sure behaviour, and scaling asymptotics. The following theorems are valid on any complex or almost-complex symplectic manifold $(M, \\omega)$, equipped with a hermitian complex line bundle of curvature $\\omega.$ ::: theo In the complex case, the density of zeros, resp. critical points, satisfies: - [@SZ1] Complex zeros: $K^N_{1,k}(z) dV = \\omega^k +",
