      "extract": "A deeper question on distribution of zeros is whether sequences of individual sections tend to have equidistributed zeros. ::: theo We have: - [@SZ1] For a random sequence in the complex codimension $k$ case, $\\{s_N\\}$, $\\tilde{Z}_{s_N} \\to \\omega^k$ almost surely. - [@N] For a random sequence of spherical harmonics on $S^m, m \\geq 6$, we have $\\tilde{Z}_{s_N} \\to dvol$ almost surely. The same is true in (Cesaro)",
